{"id": "t152-005", "text": "samir's dog Biscuit has her op tmrw morning, the leg thing again. he's really worried, been googling all night. text him after to see how it went his partner Nia's away so he's on his own w/ her all wk, offered to walk her thurs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tmrw morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all night"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "all wk"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs"}]}
